WEBVTT

00:07.700 --> 00:08.967
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.033 --> 00:10.667
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.733 --> 00:12.133
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.200 --> 00:14.100
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.167 --> 00:17.133
- * Ohh... *
-*哦...*

00:17.200 --> 00:19.233
* Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.300 --> 00:21.233
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.300 --> 00:23.133
- * Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.200 --> 00:24.867
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:24.933 --> 00:27.267
- * If nautical nonsense
be something you wish *
- *如果航海废话
成为你所希望的*

00:27.333 --> 00:29.333
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.400 --> 00:31.200
- * Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish *
- * 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 *

00:31.267 --> 00:33.233
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.300 --> 00:35.100
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.167 --> 00:37.233
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.300 --> 00:39.367
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.433 --> 00:40.700
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.767 --> 00:42.567
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.633 --> 00:45.300
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.367 --> 00:47.600
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:47.667 --> 00:49.267
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.867 --> 00:54.800
[retro adventurous music]
【复古冒险音乐】

00:54.867 --> 01:00.100
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

01:00.167 --> 01:02.400
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

01:03.233 --> 01:05.867
[mysterious music]
[神秘的音乐]

01:05.933 --> 01:08.400
- [imitates static] This is
Junior Crime Breaker SpongeBob,
- [模仿静电] 这是
少年破案海绵宝宝，

01:08.467 --> 01:10.367
reporting to
Junior Crime Breaker Patrick.
向
少年破案犯帕特里克。

01:10.433 --> 01:12.267
[imitates static]
There are no signs of crime
[模仿静电]
没有任何犯罪迹象

01:12.333 --> 01:14.700
in front of my house.
Any criminal activity by you?
在我家前面。
您有任何犯罪活动吗？

01:14.767 --> 01:17.167
Over.
[imitates static]
超过。
[模仿静电]

01:19.333 --> 01:20.533
- [imitates static]
- [模仿静电]

01:20.600 --> 01:22.300
Uh...I've got a visual
呃……我有视觉效果

01:22.367 --> 01:27.167
on a old lady tying her shoes.
一位正在系鞋带的老太太。

01:27.233 --> 01:29.067
[whispering]
She's doing the granny knot.
[窃窃私语]
她正在打奶奶结。

01:29.100 --> 01:32.233
- Oh, I'll give you
a granny knot!
-哦，我给你
一个奶奶结！

01:32.300 --> 01:34.467
- [grunts]
All clear!
- [咕哝]
一切都清楚了！

01:34.533 --> 01:36.700
No crime here.
- [chomps]
这里没有犯罪。
- [咀嚼]

01:36.767 --> 01:37.800
[boing]
[嗡嗡声]

01:37.867 --> 01:40.767
- [laughing]
- [笑]

01:40.833 --> 01:43.067
- [imitates static]
Patrick, emergency meeting
- [模仿静电]
帕特里克，紧急会议

01:43.100 --> 01:44.500
at Squidward's house--ASAP!
到章鱼哥家里——尽快！

01:44.567 --> 01:46.067
- [humming]
- Oh, please, Squidward,
- [嗡嗡声]
-哦，求你了，章鱼哥，

01:46.133 --> 01:47.967
don't move away!
You can't leave
别走开！
你不能离开

01:48.067 --> 01:50.200
the neighborhood!
Aw, we were just starting
邻居！
噢，我们才刚刚开始

01:50.267 --> 01:53.267
to get close.
[whimpers]
靠近。
[呜咽]

01:53.333 --> 01:54.967
- [inhales deeply]
I swear,
- [深吸一口气]
我发誓，

01:55.067 --> 01:58.700
I'll haunt your nightmares
if you move away!
我会困扰你的噩梦
如果你搬走！

01:58.767 --> 02:03.367
- I'm not moving away,
you brainless bottom feeders!
- 我不会离开，
你们这些无脑的底层喂食者！

02:03.433 --> 02:06.100
[munching, swallowing]
[咀嚼、吞咽]

02:06.167 --> 02:08.633
I'm just taking
a week's vacation
我只是在拿
一周的假期

02:08.700 --> 02:10.100
away from you morons.
离你们这些白痴远点。

02:10.167 --> 02:12.167
- [squeals]
- [尖叫声]

02:12.233 --> 02:14.600
[whispering]
Thank you.
[窃窃私语]
谢谢你。

02:14.667 --> 02:16.167
[shouts]
[喊叫]

02:16.233 --> 02:18.900
Let me help you carry this.
- No--wait, no!
让我帮你搬运这个。
- 不——等等，不！

02:18.967 --> 02:20.700
- [struggles, shouts]
- [挣扎，喊叫]

02:20.767 --> 02:24.367
Oh--your unmentionables.
- [grumbling angrily]
哦——你的不可告人的事。
- [愤怒地抱怨]

02:24.433 --> 02:26.467
- I won't mention this bra.
- 我不会提到这个胸罩。

02:26.533 --> 02:29.267
- It's not a bra!
It's a pectoral girdle.
- 这不是胸罩！
这是胸带。

02:29.333 --> 02:31.100
I don't care about my clothes.
我不关心我的衣服。

02:31.167 --> 02:34.067
I just wanna get away
from you two.
我只是想离开
来自你们两个。

02:34.133 --> 02:36.767
And while I'm away--
huh...
当我不在的时候——
呵呵...

02:36.833 --> 02:38.200
- [struggling]
- [挣扎]

02:38.267 --> 02:40.067
[squeals quietly]
- [grunts, mumbles]
[小声尖叫]
- [咕哝声，咕哝声]

02:40.100 --> 02:42.967
- [incoherent screaming]
- [语无伦次的尖叫声]

02:43.067 --> 02:44.633
[growls]
[咆哮]

02:44.700 --> 02:46.233
While I am gone,
当我不在的时候，

02:46.300 --> 02:49.067
there will be a paying guest
renting my place.
将会有一位付费客人
租我的地方。

02:49.100 --> 02:51.133
Don't bother him!
别打扰他！

02:51.200 --> 02:52.667
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

02:52.733 --> 02:54.133
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

02:54.200 --> 02:56.067
[wheels screech]
[车轮的尖叫声]

02:56.067 --> 02:58.733
- [imitates static] This is
Junior Crime Breaker SpongeBob
- [模仿静电] 这是
少年破案海绵宝宝

02:58.800 --> 03:00.100
to Junior Crime Breaker Patrick.
少年破案犯帕特里克。

03:00.167 --> 03:02.233
I've got a visual on a cab.
我看到了出租车上的景象。

03:02.300 --> 03:04.067
Can you get a make
on who the passenger is?
你能得到一个品牌吗
乘客是谁？

03:04.067 --> 03:05.567
Over.
[imitates static]
超过。
[模仿静电]

03:05.633 --> 03:07.600
- [imitates static]
I can't see anything
- [模仿静电]
我什么也看不见

03:07.667 --> 03:10.667
through these unmentionables.
[imitates static]
通过这些不可告人的事情。
[模仿静电]

03:10.733 --> 03:12.833
announcer: Who's
this tacky tourist
播音员：谁
这个俗气的游客

03:12.900 --> 03:14.667
turning up in a taxi?
出现在出租车上？

03:14.733 --> 03:16.867
Why, it's none other than
that mortal enemy
为什么，不是别人，正是
那个死敌

03:16.933 --> 03:19.200
of Mermaid Man
and Barnacle Boy,
人鱼男的
和藤壶男孩，

03:19.267 --> 03:21.200
the evil Man Ray!
邪恶的曼·雷！

03:21.267 --> 03:23.633
- Hey, dude, keep it down.
=> - 嘿，伙计，小声点。

03:23.700 --> 03:25.833
I'm not doing
any evil this week.
我没有做
本周有任何邪恶的事情发生。

03:25.900 --> 03:27.067
I'm on vacation!
我在度假！

03:27.100 --> 03:28.267
announcer: Really?
播音员：真的吗？

03:28.333 --> 03:30.067
- Yes, really.
- 是的，真的。

03:30.067 --> 03:33.067
[humming cheerily]
[欢快地哼唱]

03:33.067 --> 03:34.133
[Patrick and SpongeBob panting]
[帕特里克和海绵宝宝气喘吁吁]

03:34.200 --> 03:35.733
- Aw, he went inside!
- 噢，他进去了！

03:35.800 --> 03:38.233
Patrick, wouldn't it be great
to have another friend
帕特里克，这不是很棒吗
多一个朋友

03:38.300 --> 03:39.967
who can join
our Junior Crime Breakers?
谁可以加入
我们的少年犯罪破坏者？

03:40.067 --> 03:42.233
Ooh, I gotta get a look at him!
- [squealing quietly]
噢，我得看看他！
- [小声尖叫]

03:42.300 --> 03:44.533
We can blast him out.
- No, no!
我们可以把他轰出去。
- 不，不！

03:44.600 --> 03:46.267
Squidward said
not to bother the man.
章鱼哥说
不要去打扰那个男人。

03:46.333 --> 03:50.133
- [grunts]
- So, we gotta be sneaky.
- [咕哝]
- 所以，我们必须偷偷摸摸。

03:50.200 --> 03:53.067
[sneaky music]
[偷偷摸摸的音乐]

03:53.133 --> 03:55.067
[stifles shout]
Shh!
[窒息喊叫]
嘘！

03:55.133 --> 03:57.533
He must've gone upstairs.
他肯定已经上楼了。

03:57.600 --> 03:59.200
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

03:59.267 --> 04:00.833
- Well, how do we get up there?
- 那么，我们怎么上去呢？

04:00.900 --> 04:02.833
- "Eye" have just the thing!
——“眼”有正事！

04:02.900 --> 04:04.067
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

04:04.133 --> 04:05.200
Ow!
噢！

04:05.267 --> 04:07.333
[grunts, shouts]
[咕哝声，喊叫声]

04:08.833 --> 04:10.500
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

04:10.567 --> 04:14.933
[shivers]
Oh, it's getting chilly.
[发抖]
哦，天气变冷了。

04:15.067 --> 04:16.067
- Ow!
[groans weakly]
- 噢！
[微弱地呻吟]

04:16.100 --> 04:17.567
D'ow!
哎哟！

04:17.633 --> 04:19.500
Ow!
噢！

04:19.567 --> 04:20.467
Oof!
钱币！

04:20.533 --> 04:21.933
[yelps]
Ow.
[尖叫声]
噢。

04:22.067 --> 04:23.400
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

04:23.467 --> 04:25.800
[doorbell rings]
Now, I know Squidward said
[门铃响]
现在，我知道章鱼哥说过

04:25.867 --> 04:27.100
not to bother his guest,
不打扰他的客人，

04:27.167 --> 04:28.433
but there's nothing wrong
但没有什么问题

04:28.500 --> 04:30.933
with a
welcome-to-the-neighborhood pie.
与一个
欢迎来到邻居馅饼。

04:31.067 --> 04:33.467
[giggling squeal]
[咯咯地尖叫]

04:33.533 --> 04:35.367
- Oh!
May I help you?
- 哦！
我可以帮你吗？

04:35.433 --> 04:37.400
I was just finishing up
in the bathroom.
我刚刚完成
在浴室里。

04:37.467 --> 04:39.333
- Hello.
Welcome to the neighborhood!
- 你好。
欢迎来到邻居！

04:39.400 --> 04:41.500
- Don't mind us.
- Wha...
- 别介意我们。
- 世界卫生大会...

04:41.567 --> 04:43.367
Hmm!
唔！

04:43.433 --> 04:44.733
- [grunts heavily]
- [重重地咕哝]

04:44.800 --> 04:46.267
- Is this sand?
- 这是沙子吗？

04:46.333 --> 04:49.200
- Hamper sand--
from my hamper.
- 礼篮沙--
从我的篮子里。

04:49.267 --> 04:50.433
- [quietly]
Ugh!
- [安静地]
呃！

04:50.500 --> 04:51.967
- Yeah, stranger,
- 是的，陌生人，

04:52.067 --> 04:54.100
we got a nice little town here--
我们这里有一个漂亮的小镇——

04:54.167 --> 04:56.100
thanks to
the Junior Crime Breakers.
感谢
少年犯罪破坏者。

04:56.167 --> 04:58.267
And we're always looking
for new members.
我们一直在寻找
对于新会员。

04:58.333 --> 05:00.300
You look pretty fit.
- SpongeBob.
你看起来很健康。
- 海绵宝宝。

05:00.367 --> 05:02.467
He's not putting out
any snacks for us.
他没有推出
任何零食给我们。

05:02.533 --> 05:05.067
- Oh, sorry!
How rude of me.
- 哦，对不起！
我真粗鲁。

05:05.067 --> 05:06.533
Hmm...ooh!
嗯……哦！

05:06.600 --> 05:08.133
All I have is this pie.
我只有这个馅饼。

05:08.200 --> 05:11.067
- Don't mind if I do.
- 如果我这样做的话，请不要介意。

05:11.067 --> 05:12.333
[gobbling]
[狼吞虎咽]

05:12.400 --> 05:14.733
[munching]
[咀嚼]

05:17.933 --> 05:22.167
- Eh--if you'll excuse me,
I'll finish up in the bathroom.
- 呃--请原谅我，
我会在浴室里完成。

05:22.233 --> 05:24.333
- [pants]
- [裤子]

05:24.400 --> 05:26.667
He's all outta snacks!
Let's go.
他已经没有零食了！
我们走吧。

05:26.733 --> 05:28.200
- But, Patrick, we haven't
asked him to join
- 但是，帕特里克，我们还没有
请他加入

05:28.267 --> 05:29.600
the Junior Crime Breakers yet.
少年犯罪破坏者还没有。

05:29.667 --> 05:31.233
Hello?
We were wondering if
你好？
我们想知道是否

05:31.300 --> 05:32.867
you'd like to--
[screams]
你想——
[尖叫声]

05:32.933 --> 05:34.867
[panting franticly]
[疯狂地喘气]

05:34.933 --> 05:36.767
[stuttering]
[结巴]

05:36.833 --> 05:38.200
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

05:38.267 --> 05:40.900
- [quietly]
Evil villain Man Ray.
- [安静地]
邪恶的恶棍曼·雷。

05:40.967 --> 05:42.533
[ominous trumpet tune]
[不祥的喇叭曲]

05:42.600 --> 05:44.733
- Now, what were you saying?
- 现在，你在说什么？

05:44.800 --> 05:46.467
Hmm?
What?
唔？
什么？

05:46.533 --> 05:48.067
Hmm?
唔？

05:48.067 --> 05:49.267
Hmm.
唔。

05:49.333 --> 05:51.067
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

05:51.067 --> 05:52.567
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

05:52.633 --> 05:54.567
- Mermaid Man!
It's Man Ray!
- 美人鱼男人！
是曼·雷！

05:54.633 --> 05:57.867
He's right inside
Squidward's...place.
他就在里面
章鱼哥的……地方。

05:57.933 --> 05:59.333
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

05:59.400 --> 06:01.400
Too late.
Man Ray must've gotten to them.
为时已晚。
曼雷肯定已经找到他们了。

06:01.467 --> 06:02.733
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

06:02.800 --> 06:05.267
Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy
ice pops!
美人鱼人和藤壶男孩
冰棒！

06:05.333 --> 06:07.167
They finally made them!
他们终于成功了！

06:07.233 --> 06:09.700
[slurping, glass squeaking]
- Wait a minute, Patrick.
[发出声音，玻璃吱吱作响]
- 等一下，帕特里克。

06:09.767 --> 06:12.667
We're both wrong!
It says right here in issue 55.
我们都错了！
就在第 55 期这里说的。

06:12.733 --> 06:14.800
Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy
are just taking
美人鱼人和藤壶男孩
正在采取

06:14.867 --> 06:17.733
their cryonic nap.
But when they wake up in a week,
他们的冷冻小睡。
但当他们一周后醒来时，

06:17.800 --> 06:20.433
they'll be weak
for a week!
他们会很弱
一个星期！

06:20.500 --> 06:21.733
[shouts happily]
[高兴地大喊]

06:21.800 --> 06:23.567
Patrick, do you know
what this means?
帕特里克，你知道吗
这意味着什么？

06:23.633 --> 06:26.800
- I'll have to wait a week
for my Mermaid Man ice pop?
-我得等一个星期
给我的美人鱼人冰棒？

06:26.867 --> 06:28.900
- Yes and no.
It means that
- 是和不是。
这意味着

06:28.967 --> 06:31.967
you and I will have to be
Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy,
你和我必须
美人鱼人和藤壶男孩，

06:32.067 --> 06:34.367
and stop Man Ray's vacation
of...
并停止曼雷的假期
的...

06:34.433 --> 06:37.133
[thunder claps]
Evil!
[雷鸣般的掌声]
邪恶！

06:37.200 --> 06:39.333
[together]
By the power of Neptune,
[一起]
借助海王星的力量，

06:39.400 --> 06:42.567
Mermaid Pants
and Barnacle Star unite!
人鱼裤
和藤壶星联合起来！

06:42.633 --> 06:45.300
[victorious music]
[胜利的音乐]

06:46.400 --> 06:49.333
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

06:49.400 --> 06:51.533
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

06:51.600 --> 06:55.067
- [slurping]
- Patrick, is that...
- [发出声音]
- 帕特里克，那是……

06:55.100 --> 06:57.067
I couldn't wait a week!
我等了一个星期都等不及了！

06:57.133 --> 06:58.600
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

06:58.667 --> 07:01.367
Yow!
- [shouting]
哟！
- [喊叫]

07:01.433 --> 07:03.367
- [struggling]
- [growling]
- [挣扎]
- [咆哮]

07:03.433 --> 07:05.067
Ah-ah-ah--
啊啊啊啊——

07:05.067 --> 07:06.300
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

07:06.367 --> 07:08.567
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

07:08.633 --> 07:09.700
[trash cans rattling]
[垃圾桶嘎嘎作响]

07:09.767 --> 07:12.067
- Good thing I'm so stealthy,
- 还好我很隐秘

07:12.100 --> 07:13.533
huh, Mermaid Pants?
嗯，美人鱼裤？

07:13.600 --> 07:15.800
Ah!
The stealth!
啊!
隐身！

07:15.867 --> 07:17.500
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

07:17.567 --> 07:20.167
[metal crashing]
[金属碰撞]

07:20.233 --> 07:21.633
- Huh?
- 啊？

07:21.700 --> 07:22.967
Hmm?
唔？

07:23.067 --> 07:24.700
Hmm!
唔！

07:24.767 --> 07:27.700
[both grunting quietly]
[两人都低声咕哝]

07:27.767 --> 07:28.633
- Ow!
- 噢！

07:28.700 --> 07:32.200
[both shouting menacingly]
[两人都威胁地喊道]

07:32.267 --> 07:33.200
- [shouts]
- [喊叫]

07:33.267 --> 07:35.400
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

07:35.467 --> 07:37.633
[debris clatters]
- Intruders?
[碎片碰撞声]
- 入侵者？

07:37.700 --> 07:40.167
Mm-hmm...
I've got to call the cops.
嗯嗯...
我得报警。

07:40.233 --> 07:42.200
What am I doing?
我在做什么？

07:42.267 --> 07:44.567
Villains don't call the police!
坏人不报警！

07:44.633 --> 07:46.567
[sighs]
I didn't think to bring
[叹气]
没想到要带

07:46.633 --> 07:49.267
any evil super-weapons
on vacation!
任何邪恶的超级武器
度假了！

07:49.333 --> 07:51.167
I'm unarmed!
我手无寸铁！

07:51.233 --> 07:52.833
Huh?
啊？

07:52.900 --> 07:54.700
- Who'da thunk that Squidward
would be stockpiling
- 谁会想到那个章鱼哥
会囤积的

07:54.767 --> 07:57.067
such a huge arsenal
of evil super-weapons?
如此庞大的军火库
邪恶的超级武器？

07:57.100 --> 08:01.967
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

08:02.067 --> 08:04.067
So stale, yet so deadly.
如此陈腐，却又如此致命。

08:04.100 --> 08:05.433
[whimpering nervously]
[紧张地呜咽]

08:05.500 --> 08:07.300
[shouts, thuds]
[喊叫声，重击声]

08:07.367 --> 08:11.233
I got my weapon!
我拿到武器了！

08:11.300 --> 08:12.733
- [grunting approvingly]
- [赞同地咕哝]

08:12.800 --> 08:17.067
[both singing, shouting]
[两人都唱着、喊着]

08:17.067 --> 08:18.167
- * Dum-dah-dah *
- * 达姆达达 *

08:18.233 --> 08:20.433
- Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy?
- 美人鱼人和藤壶男孩？

08:20.500 --> 08:22.133
I knew you guys were old,
我就知道你们都老了

08:22.200 --> 08:26.867
but I had no idea you mutated.
- Surrender, Man Ray!
但我不知道你变异了。
- 投降，曼·雷！

08:26.933 --> 08:28.467
- I'm on holiday.
- 我正在度假。

08:28.533 --> 08:30.867
- Yeah, an evil holiday!
- 是的，一个邪恶的假期！

08:30.933 --> 08:34.733
- Prepare to be framed!
[grunts]
- 准备好被陷害吧！
[咕哝]

08:34.800 --> 08:36.067
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

08:36.100 --> 08:37.433
[vase shatters]
[花瓶碎裂]

08:37.500 --> 08:39.700
announcer: Vase vaporized!
播音员：花瓶蒸发了！

08:39.767 --> 08:41.100
[adventurous music]
[冒险音乐]

08:41.167 --> 08:43.267
- Here's a dessert
that's sure to hurt!
- 这是一份甜点
那肯定会受伤！

08:43.333 --> 08:44.533
[shouts]
[喊叫]

08:44.600 --> 08:46.600
- Huh?
[shouts]
- 啊？
[喊叫]

08:46.667 --> 08:48.400
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

08:48.467 --> 08:50.667
announcer: Figurines fractured!
播音员：雕像断裂了！

08:50.733 --> 08:53.067
[cookies ricocheting]
- [grunts]
[饼干弹跳]
- [咕哝]

08:53.100 --> 08:54.967
[both whimpering]
[两人都呜咽]

08:55.067 --> 08:56.300
[both panting fearfully]
[两人都惊恐地喘着气]

08:56.367 --> 08:57.533
[shouting]
[喊叫]

08:57.600 --> 08:58.933
- [growling]
- [shouting]
- [咆哮]
- [喊叫]

08:59.067 --> 09:00.767
No, no, no, no,
不，不，不，不，

09:00.833 --> 09:01.967
no!
不！

09:02.067 --> 09:03.633
[wailing]
[哀号]

09:05.400 --> 09:06.667
- All right, Man Ray.
- 好吧，曼雷。

09:06.733 --> 09:09.633
I will snare you
in my "clara-net"!
我会网罗你
在我的“clara-net”中！

09:09.700 --> 09:11.433
[sour clarinet notes]
[酸单簧管音符]

09:11.500 --> 09:13.500
- [grunts, shouts]
Oof!
- [咕哝声，喊叫声]
噢！

09:13.567 --> 09:14.933
- [inhales purposefully]
- [有目的地吸气]

09:15.067 --> 09:15.867
Uh...
呃...

09:15.933 --> 09:18.500
I can't think of anything!
我什么也想不出来！

09:18.567 --> 09:20.367
[shouting]
[喊叫]

09:20.433 --> 09:23.167
- [muffled grunting]
- [低沉的咕哝声]

09:23.233 --> 09:24.367
[both shout]
[两人大喊]

09:24.433 --> 09:25.967
announcer: Table toppled!
播音员：桌子翻倒了！

09:26.067 --> 09:29.067
[all shouting,
thunder booms]
[大家都喊着，
雷霆轰鸣]

09:29.100 --> 09:30.333
[planks clatter]
[木板碰撞声]

09:30.400 --> 09:31.600
[Patrick and SpongeBob shouting]
[帕特里克和海绵宝宝大喊]

09:31.667 --> 09:33.967
- I just wanted a vacation!
- 我只是想要一个假期！

09:34.067 --> 09:36.667
- Evil never takes a vacation!
- 邪恶永远不会休假！

09:36.733 --> 09:38.700
- [stammers]
Did you just make that up?
- [结巴]
这是你刚刚编出来的吗？

09:38.767 --> 09:40.433
Because that sounds pretty good.
因为这听起来不错。

09:40.500 --> 09:42.333
Do you mind if
I use it sometime?
你介意吗
我有时用它？

09:42.400 --> 09:43.900
- Help yourself, Man Ray.
- 救救自己吧，曼雷。

09:43.967 --> 09:46.667
- Yeah, help yourself to pain!
- 是的，帮助自己止痛！

09:46.733 --> 09:48.267
[thunder clapping]
[雷鸣般的掌声]

09:48.333 --> 09:49.633
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:49.700 --> 09:51.467
- [groans]
Why did I ever bother
- [呻吟]
我为什么要费心

09:51.533 --> 09:52.967
trying to be normal?
试图变得正常？

09:53.067 --> 09:55.133
I am Man Ray!
我是曼·雷！

09:55.200 --> 09:57.267
Feel my evil wrath!
感受我邪恶的愤怒吧！

09:57.333 --> 09:59.400
[thunder booms]
[雷霆轰鸣]

09:59.467 --> 10:02.567
[all growling]
[全都咆哮]

10:02.633 --> 10:04.467
[all yelping]
[全都尖叫]

10:04.533 --> 10:06.600
[all shouting]
[大家大喊]

10:06.667 --> 10:08.400
[phone ringing]
- Huh?
[电话铃声]
- 啊？

10:08.467 --> 10:11.567
Hold on.
I should get this.
坚持，稍等。
我应该得到这个。

10:11.633 --> 10:14.133
Hello?
- Hello, Man Ray?
你好？
- 你好，曼·雷？

10:14.200 --> 10:17.333
The weather changed my plans.
I'm coming home.
天气改变了我的计划。
我要回家了。

10:17.400 --> 10:19.367
[grunts]
Not to worry, though.
[咕哝]
不过不用担心。

10:19.433 --> 10:21.800
You'll get a full refund
on the rent,
您将获得全额退款
在租金上，

10:21.867 --> 10:24.900
so long as there's no damage
to my place.
只要没有损坏
到我的地方。

10:24.967 --> 10:26.667
[dial tone]
Hello?
[拨号音]
你好？

10:26.733 --> 10:28.400
- [laughs evilly]
- [邪恶地笑]

10:28.467 --> 10:30.367
That idiot octopus doesn't know
那只白痴章鱼不知道

10:30.433 --> 10:32.367
I gave him a phony check!
我给了他一张假支票！

10:32.433 --> 10:34.167
[shouts victoriously]
[胜利的呼喊]

10:34.233 --> 10:37.367
You were right about me
after all, dopey duo.
你对我的看法是对的
毕竟，愚蠢的二人组。

10:37.433 --> 10:40.433
Evil never takes a vacation!
邪恶永远不会休假！

10:40.500 --> 10:41.667
- Ooh!
Definitely sounds
- 哦！
绝对听起来

10:41.733 --> 10:43.133
a lot cooler
when he says it.
凉爽多了
当他这么说的时候。

10:43.200 --> 10:45.733
[horn honking]
- Ah, here's my Scuber.
[喇叭鸣响]
- 啊，这是我的 Scuber。

10:45.800 --> 10:47.400
[cheery tune]
[欢快的曲调]

10:47.467 --> 10:48.900
[grunts]
[咕哝]

10:48.967 --> 10:50.500
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

10:50.567 --> 10:52.767
- Maybe one day
Man Ray will reform
- 也许有一天
曼雷将改革

10:52.833 --> 10:54.867
and join
the Junior Crime Breakers.
并加入
少年犯罪破坏者。

10:54.933 --> 10:56.033
[boing]
[嗡嗡声]

10:56.100 --> 10:57.400
Huh?
啊？

10:57.467 --> 10:59.867
- Man, he really
trashed this place.
- 伙计，他真的
毁掉了这个地方。

11:00.067 --> 11:02.967
- Okay, Barnacle Star!
Let's be super good
- 好吧，藤壶星！
让我们变得超级优秀

11:03.067 --> 11:04.667
and glue all
of Squidward's stuff
并粘合所有
章鱼哥的东西

11:04.733 --> 11:07.500
back together!
- Well, how do we do that?
一起回来！
- 那么，我们该怎么做呢？

11:07.567 --> 11:08.567
- [chuckling] Oh, Patrick,
it's right here
- [咯咯笑]哦，帕特里克，
就在这里

11:08.633 --> 11:11.133
in issue 14.
[slurps]
在第 14 期。
[啜饮]

11:11.200 --> 11:13.233
We have super saliva!
我们口水超级多！

11:13.300 --> 11:15.067
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

11:15.100 --> 11:18.433
[slurping]
[发出声音]

11:18.500 --> 11:19.567
- Ow!
- 噢！

11:19.633 --> 11:21.267
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

11:21.333 --> 11:23.700
[slurping, humming]
[发出声音，哼哼]

11:23.767 --> 11:30.567
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

11:30.633 --> 11:31.567
[splashing]
[溅]

11:31.633 --> 11:33.067
- Hello?
- 你好？

11:33.100 --> 11:36.533
[shimmering tones
and harp music]
[闪烁的色调
和竖琴音乐]

11:36.600 --> 11:38.933
- Oh, looks like
my guest left already.
- 哦，看起来像
我的客人已经离开了。

11:39.067 --> 11:42.267
[sighs contentedly]
Home sweet...
[满足地叹气]
回家甜...

11:42.333 --> 11:45.067
[shouting]
[喊叫]

11:46.833 --> 11:48.333
[groaning]
Home.
[呻吟]
回家。

[呻吟]
回家。